  "name": "Spartan Hoplite",
  "type": "class",
  "img": "icons/svg/combat.svg",
  "system": {
    "description": "<p>Constitution-based Paladin class built around shield-based defense and holding the line.</p><p>TypeA Constitution-based Paladin classStat BonusCon +3, Str +2Stat PenaltyDex -2, Int -1The Spartan Hoplite deals mostly with discipline, shield-based defense, and refusing to move when every reasonable instinct says otherwise. A Hoplite is strongest when protecting their allies and anchoring a battle line — elite at turning narrow corridors into very educational stabbing funnels. Their power comes from conviction and training.<br>Class Benefits:<br>Radiant Tip spell — imbue the tip of your weapon with Radiant damage<br>Aegis Flash spell — a flash of light erupts from your shield, disorienting nearby enemies<br>Shieldbash skill — slams a target with your shield, sending them backwards<br>Spear Brace skill — root yourself in place, using your spear to brace for impact<br>+3 to Shield-based skills<br>+3 to Spear-based skills</p>",
    "notes": "+3 Constitution (3 Points)\n+3 Strength (3 Points)\nBenefit requires tier review: Hoplite Formation Buff: Once per day, give your allies in your party +1 DR if they are standing adjacent to you (3 Points)\nBenefit requires tier review: Can gain access to any Weapon Training Guild (2)\nDetriment requires tier review: 2 Dexterity (+1 Build Point)\nrank20: None\nbonusBox: Silver Earth Box",
